{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52104","headline":"四言曲池酺饮座铭 · 张文琮","name":"四言曲池酺饮座铭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"和风习习，落景沉沉。\n俯映绿水，仰睎翠林。\n友朋好合，如□瑟琴。\n勉矣君子，俱奉尧心。\n（《翰林学士集》）（按：此诗原署「酆王友张文琮」。\n张步云《唐代逸诗辑存》收入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张文琮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52104.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52104","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}